\begin_inset Formula $wF$
\end_inset

 is given by:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
U(wF)\equiv{\displaystyle \int}u(wt)\ dF(t)={\displaystyle \int}u(w\cdot)\ dF
\]

\end_inset

