\begin_inset Formula $wF$
\end_inset

 is also the expected utility of the random variable distributed 
\begin_inset Formula $F$
\end_inset

 for the agent with utility function 
\begin_inset Formula $u(w\cdot)$
\end_inset

, which is the horizontal contraction of 
\begin_inset Formula $u$
\end_inset

 to the left by the ratio 
\begin_inset Formula $\frac{1}{w}$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
