, then he/she will prefer 
\begin_inset Formula $F$
\end_inset

 to the certain multiplicative change in wealth 
\begin_inset Formula $c$
\end_inset

 at any level of wealth higher than 
\begin_inset Formula $w$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

