\begin_inset Formula $x$
\end_inset

 be the part of agent 
\begin_inset Formula $A\mbox{'s}$
\end_inset

 wealth invested in the risky asset.
 The amount invested in the safe asset is 
\begin_inset Formula $w-x$
\end_inset

.
