\begin_inset Formula $c(l,u[(w-\underline{p})+\cdot])$
\end_inset

 is the certaintly equivalent of 
\begin_inset Formula $l$
\end_inset

 with respect to 
\begin_inset Formula $u\left[(w-\underline{p})+\cdot\right]$
\end_inset

.
 Hence,
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
w=c(l,u[(w-\underline{p})+\cdot])
\]

\end_inset


